  "description": "ADO-PERSIST Save forms on a client static read-only Recordset of SELECT ID, Code, L, S FROM T ORDER BY ID: Save(path) with the format omitted (reopen with adCmdFile: State, RecordCount, then the file kept); Save to the same path again with no flag; with adSaveCreateNotExist; with adSaveCreateOverWrite; with adSaveCreateOverWrite and adPersistXML on the same path (reopen); Save with Format 99; Save with Destination omitted; Save after Close. Each reads the Errors (cleared). Asks the default format, which flags overwrite and which forms are refused.",
